        move('the Sifrei 144:2-5 (read whole at the reading); cold_run_ordinances (CALL) — OR.courts(twenty_three) = %s; cold_run_opening_speech (CALL) — OP(the_court_of_three) = %s' % (OR_23, OP_THREE[:50]), "THE THREE TIERS — the court for all Israel (144:1), every tribe's court (144:2-3), every city's court in its gate (144:4); 'in all your gates' compares the great Sanhedrin to the small: as the great judges and executes, so the small (144:5 — Mishnah Sanhedrin 1:1, 1:4 the seventy-one and the twenty-three by CALL; the court of three for money): A PARAMETER the_three_tiers")
