        move('the Sifrei 144:11 (read whole at the reading); cold_run_ordinances (CALL) — OR.courts(bribe) = %s, (bribe_absolute) = %s; cold_run_second_tablets (CALL) — ST(takes_no_bribe) = %s; ST(the_permitted_fee) = %s; cold_run_holiness (CALL) — HO.conduct(bribe) = %s; the one database — bribe_barred on %s' % (OR_BRIBE, OR_ABS, ST_BRIBE[:70], ST_FEE[:50], HO_BRIBE, BRIBE_SCAN), "TAKE NO BRIBE — Exodus 23:8's BLOCK bribe_barred on the judge, DECLARED at the ordinances' cell and NEVER WRITTEN ON ANY ENTITY (DB7's declaration; 10:17 the callee's own '16:19 the command's seat forward'): WRITTEN HERE FOR THE FIRST TIME at 16:19's line — bribery absolute, even to judge truly (the Mekhilta; Ketubot 105a by the second-tablets cell); the permitted fee for evident loss the exception; the bribed judge's eyes dim (Peah 8:9 by CALL): THE REUSE bribe_barred's first entry on israel_people")
        dat('THE WRITE bribe_barred — Exodus 23:8\'s BLOCK, its FIRST entry on israel_people at the counter\'s day (DH2; DB7\'s "NEVER" 0 -> 1 retyped before the tape); the exam\'s person the judge who takes a bribe to judge truly — barred from it')
